Forward melonDS microphone hooks to Host and expose SPU audio interpolation.

Connects Platform::Mic_Start, Mic_Stop and Mic_ReadInput through NDS userdata to
Host callbacks without adding global state or platform audio dependencies to the
engine. Also exposes melonDS SPU sample interpolation on RuntimeOptions and
Runtime::set_audio_interpolation (applied at frame boundaries; default None).

